      "contentHtml": "<p></p> <p> </p><div class=\"slide\"><div class=\"slide-title\"><span>Mẫu đàm thoại 1</span></div><div class=\"slide-content\"><p></p> <p> <img decoding=\"async\" alt=\"\" src=\"/images/minnamoi/bai34/renshuuC-1.jpg\" style=\"width: 300px; \"></p> <p> <audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\"><source src=\"/Audio/minnarenshuc/10000111010.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\"></audio></p> <table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"khung\" style=\" width: 100%;\"> <tbody> <tr> <td style=\"width: 60px;\"> <span style=\"color:#000080;\"><strong><span>A:</span></strong></span></td> <td> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\">この ①<u>カレー</u>、ミラーさんが <ruby>作<rp>(</rp><rt>つく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ったんですか。</div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Món cà ri này, anh Miller đã làm đó hả?</div></div></div></td> </tr> <tr> <td> <span style=\"color:#000080;\"><strong><span>B: </span></strong></span></td> <td> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\">ええ。②<u><ruby>友達<rp>(</rp><rt>ともだち</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に <ruby>教<rp>(</rp><rt>おし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>えて もらった</u> とおりに <ruby>作<rp>(</rp><rt>つく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ったんですが････。</div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Vâng. Tôi đã làm theo những gì bạn tôi dạy cho tôi.</div></div></div></td> </tr> <tr> <td> <span style=\"color:#000080;\"><strong><span>A:</span></strong></span></td> <td> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\">とても おいしいです。</div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Rất là ngon đó.</div></div></div></td> </tr> <tr> <td> <span style=\"color:#000080;\"><strong><span>B:</span></strong></span></td> <td> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\">ああ、よかった。</div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">A, tốt quá.</div></div></div></td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p> <span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 128);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span><strong>Luyện tập: </strong></span></span></span></span></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><em><span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">[thay thế vị trí gạch chân bằng nội dung bên dưới]</span></em></span></p> <p> <span>1)</span></p> <p> ① てんぷら</p> <p> ② テレビの <ruby>料理番組<rp>(</rp><rt>りょうりばんぐみ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で <ruby>見<rp>(</rp><rt>み</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ました</p> <p> <span>2)</span></p> <p> ① ケーキ</p> <p> ② テレビの <ruby>料理<rp>(</rp><rt>りょうり</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>番組<rp>(</rp><rt>ばんぐみ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で <ruby>見<rp>(</rp><rt>み</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ました</p> <p> </p></div></div><p></p> <p> </p><div class=\"slide\"><div class=\"slide-title\"><span>Mẫu đàm thoại 2</span></div><div class=\"slide-content\"><p></p> <p> <img decoding=\"async\" alt=\"\" src=\"/images/minnamoi/bai34/renshuuC-2.jpg\" style=\"width: 300px; \"></p> <p> <audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\"><source src=\"/Audio/minnarenshuc/10000111011.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\"></audio></p> <table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"khung\" style=\" width: 100%;\"> <tbody> <tr> <td style=\"width: 60px;\"> <span style=\"color:#000080;\"><strong><span>A:</span></strong></span></td> <td> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><ruby>課長<rp>(</rp><rt>かちょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>、ちょっと <ruby>出張<rp>(</rp><rt>しゅっちょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の レポートを <ruby>見<rp>(</rp><rt>み</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>て いただけませんか。</div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Tổ trưởng, anh xem cho tôi báo cáo công tác này một chút được không ạ?</div></div></div></td> </tr> <tr> <td> <span style=\"color:#000080;\"><strong><span>B: </span></strong></span></td> <td> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\">①<u><ruby>今<rp>(</rp><rt>いま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>から <ruby>会議<rp>(</rp><rt>かいぎ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>です</u>から、②<u><ruby>会議<rp>(</rp><rt>かいぎ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が <ruby>終<rp>(</rp><rt>おわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>った</u> あとで、<ruby>見<rp>(</rp><rt>み</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ます。</div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Bây giờ có cuộc họp nên sau khi họp kết thúc tôi sẽ xem.</div></div></div></td> </tr> <tr> <td> <span style=\"color:#000080;\"><strong><span>A:</span></strong></span></td> <td> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\">お<ruby>願<rp>(</rp><rt>ねが</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いします。</div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Xin nhờ anh.</div></div></div></td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p> <span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 128);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span><strong>Luyện tập: </strong></span></span></span></span></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><em><span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">[thay thế vị trí gạch chân bằng nội dung bên dưới]</span></em></span></p> <p> <span>1)</span></p> <p> ① お<ruby>客<rp>(</rp><rt>きゃく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>さんが <ruby>来<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ます</p> <p> ② お<ruby>客<rp>(</rp><rt>きゃく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>さんが <ruby>帰<rp>(</rp><rt>かえ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ります</p> <p> <span>2)</span></p> <p> ① もうすぐ １２<ruby>時<rp>(</rp><rt>じ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>です</p> <p> ② <ruby>昼<rp>(</rp><rt>ひる</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ごはんを <ruby>食<rp>(</rp><rt>た</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>べます</p> <p> </p></div></div><p></p> <p> </p><div class=\"slide\"><div class=\"slide-title\"><span>Mẫu đàm thoại 3</span></div><div class=\"slide-content\"><p></p> <p> <img decoding=\"async\" alt=\"\" src=\"/images/minnamoi/bai34/renshuuC-3.jpg\" style=\"width: 300px; \"></p> <p> <audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\"><source src=\"/Audio/minnarenshuc/10000111100.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\"></audio></p> <table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"khung\" style=\" width: 100%;\"> <tbody> <tr> <td style=\"width: 60px;\"> <span style=\"color:#000080;\"><strong><span>A:</span></strong></span></td> <td> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\">あしたは <ruby>休<rp>(</rp><rt>やす</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>みですね。 どこか <ruby>行<rp>(</rp><rt>い</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>きますか。</div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Ngày mai là ngày nghỉ rồi nhỉ. Có đi đâu không?</div></div></div></td> </tr> <tr> <td> <span style=\"color:#000080;\"><strong><span>B: </span></strong></span></td> <td> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\">いいえ。①<u>どこも <ruby>出<rp>(</rp><rt>で</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>かけない</u>で、うちで ゆっくり <ruby>休<rp>(</rp><rt>やす</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby></u>みます。<ruby>田中<rp>(</rp><rt>たなか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>さんは？</div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Không. Tôi định chẳng đi đâu cả, nghỉ ngơi thư giãn ở nhà. Còn anh Tanaka?</div></div></div></td> </tr> <tr> <td> <span style=\"color:#000080;\"><strong><span>A:</span></strong></span></td> <td> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\">②<u><ruby>子<rp>(</rp><rt>こ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>どもを プールへ <ruby>連<rp>(</rp><rt>つ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れて <ruby>行<rp>(</rp><rt>ぎょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>こう</u>と <ruby>思<rp>(</rp><rt>おも</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>って います。</div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Tôi định dẫn con đến hồ bơi.</div></div></div></td> </tr> <tr> <td> <span style=\"color:#000080;\"><strong><span>B:</span></strong></span></td> <td> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\">そうですか。</div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Vậy sao.</div></div></div></td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p> <span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 128);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span><strong>Luyện tập: </strong></span></span></span></span></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><em><spa